OL,3,GNEWSAFishermen call for level playing
OL,4,Afield with Europe
OL,5,
OL,6,FFishermen are calling for greater
OL,7,Fgovernment support to cope with rising
OL,8,Ffuel costs.
OL,10,FThe cost of red diesel has spiralled
OL,11,Fsince the start of the US-Iran war, and
OL,12,Fmany European fishing boats receive
OL,13,Fsubsidies for fuel.
OL,15,FNoah Law, Labour MP for St Austell and
OL,16,FNewquay, told Parliament this week it
OL,17,Fwas "putting our fleets at a
OL,18,Fsignificant competitive disadvantage
OL,19,Fand all too often rendering it
OL,20,Funeconomical to leave port."
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
