OL,3,GNEWSAFishermen call for level playing
OL,4,Afield with Europe
OL,5,
OL,6,FFishing minister Stephen Morgan said he
OL,7,Frecognised "the genuine hardship" high
OL,8,Ffuel prices were causing and the
OL,9,Fconcerns about competition from EU
OL,10,Ffishing boats benefiting from
OL,11,Fsubsidies.
